==Battleground==
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Camelle]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Basically a harder version of [[Chubby B. Goode]], except with [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies. [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat/Ramen Cat]] is nearly a must in this stage. Stall the beginning peons for as long as you can, as you don't want to hit the base to early. Once you hit the base, send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and/or an [[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|anti-Angel]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber]]/long-ranged Uber. The Angelic Gories are very strong, so you will want something like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to keep them at bay. Thankfully, all the Angel enemies here are limited so Camelle is easier to kill once you outlast all of them (unless you were using a [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]] cat to chip down Camelle, because chances are they won't outrange Camelle once all the other enemies are gone).

